olcano/volcano.go:343, pkg/runtime/framework/plugins/volcano/volcano.go:118]\n253\t- **RHOAI-specific flows:** The progression subsystem monitors training Pod status for job completion tracking. NetworkPolicy resources are created per TrainJob to isolate training workloads at the network level. RBAC aggregation roles enable platform admin/edit/view access patterns through Kubernetes role inheritance. [source: pkg/rhai/progression/progression.go:147, pkg/rhai/networkpolicy.go:152, manifests/rhoai/kubeflow-training-roles.yaml:45]\n254\t- **TLS and security:** On startup, the controller reads the OpenShift APIServer TLS security profile via dynamic client and applies the resolved cipher suite configuration to webhook, metrics, and status servers. All external communication to the Kubernetes API uses ServiceAccount token authentication over TLS. [source: pkg/tls/tls.go:99-104, cmd/trainer-controller-manager/main.go:120-128]\n255\t\n256\t## Integration Points\n257\t\n258\t- **/v1/ConfigMap:** Controller watch (Watches); protocol: Kubernetes API; purpose: Flux. [source: cmd/initializers/dataset/requirements.txt:1-3, go.mod, manifests/base/manager/manager.yaml:92, pkg/rhai/networkpolicy.go:157]\n259\t- **/v1/ConfigMap:** Controller watch (Watches); protocol: Kubernetes API; purpose: MPI. [source: cmd/initializers/dataset/requirements.txt:1-3, go.mod, manifests/base/manager/manager.yaml:92, pkg/rhai/networkpolicy.go:157]\n260\t- **/v1/ConfigMap:** Resource read; purpose: get operations. [source: cmd/initializers/dataset/requirements.txt:1-3, go.mod, manifests/base/manager/manager.yaml:92, pkg/rhai/networkpolicy.go:157]\n261\t- **/v1/Pod:** Resource read; purpose: list operations. [source: cmd/initializers/dataset/requirements.txt:1-3, go.mod, manifests/base/manager/manager.yaml:92, pkg/rhai/networkpolicy.go:157]\n262\t- **Additional relationships:** 13 more integration point(s) are listed in the structured table. [source: cmd/initializers/dataset/requirements.txt:1-3, go.mo